== Knife Piece ==
If Isaac has {{I|Knife Piece 1}}, a special double-sized room will spawn in Mines II containing a minecart and a broken length of rail track leading to a boarded-up door, resembling a [[Bedroom]] door. Behind this door lies the area in which {{I|Knife Piece 2}} can be acquired. There are two methods for accessing this area:
* Three {{e|Yellow Button}}s can be found in rooms throughout the floor. One will be in the same room as the broken rail track, but the other two are randomly placed. Once all three buttons are pressed, the rail track will be repaired, and once Isaac touches the minecart it will bring him into the special area.
* If Isaac has [[flight]] and 2 {{e|Bomb}}s, he can fly to the boarded-up door and blow it open. Other effects that open doors such as {{i|Dad's Key}}, {{p|Soul of Cain}}, {{i|Cracked Orb}}, etc. can also be used in place of bombs.

Upon entering this area, all [[Items#Passive Collectibles|passive items]], [[Items#Active Collectibles|active items]], and [[trinket]]s will be rendered inactive, and Isaac's {{e|Bomb}}s, {{e|Penny|text=coins}}, and {{e|Key}}s will be set to zero. Isaac will pass through several empty [[rooms]] before reaching a room with the {{I|Knife Piece 2}}. Once picked up, {{e|Mother's Shadow}} will spawn and chase Isaac until he reaches the entrance to the area and leaves. Once Isaac escapes, all his items will be reactivated, and Mother's Shadow will end her pursuit.

''For more notes and details, see {{e|Mother's Shadow}}.''

