== Trivia ==
* In [https://antibirth.com/ Antibirth], the Mines used to have a different way of unlocking {{I|Knife Piece 2}}. Somewhere on the floor, there was a room containing four [[buttons]]. In the room, next to each button, were 1 to 4 small pebbles, indicating the order in which to press them. After all four buttons were pressed, the {{I|Knife Piece 2}} would appear in the center of the room. This also wasn't the last knife piece, as there was a third piece to collect on the {{s|Mausoleum}} floor.
* {{e|Mole}}s will open their eyes if encountered in a dark room, however, this doesn't change their behavior.

